#descr "Albion is a green and fertile land inhabited by the Thyrsa, a race of bloodthirsty giants. In ages past a boat carrying princesses banished from their homeland landed on the shores of an unknown isle. Here they found a land of plenty, however soon they were visited by demonic Incubi that haunted the island and lay with them in their dreams. The children of these unions bore demon taint and grew to monstrous size. Now their offspring rule the land of Albion.
