#era 2
#descr "In a hidden valley in the high mountains a secret order of enlightened priest-mages rule over their servants. Once exiles from their ancestral lands, they have since conquered the Bhöd tribes and gained the cooperation of the ape-like Mi Gö. Having found the ancient records and secret knowledge of a long-dead people these Hidden Masters rule over the secret city of Shambhala. Using manipulation and deceit they control the Bhödpa and keep outsiders away from their refuge. The Hidden Masters are dedicated to the study of arcane and mystical secrets as they attempt to achieve enlightenment and transcend mortality itself. Now, with the rise of a new God, the Hidden Masters of Shambhala are emerging once more into the world."
