#descr "Arrada is a kingdom that long languished in the shadow of Machaka. The destruction of that ancient city by Irami zealots brought opportunity, and Great Arrada has since seized many of the Spider Lords former lands. Each king takes on the obligation to leave behind more territory than he inherited, and the kingdom wages an ongoing series of wars of conquest that have brought it power and wealth. The armies of Arrada consist of well equipped professional soldiers lead by experienced officers.
The religion of Great Arrada teaches reverence for ancestors, with royal ancestors being particularly exalted. Blood sacrifice is offered to the spirits of the dead, and each year a great Celebration takes place at the palace in which hundreds of slaves are decapitated to honour the dead kings. Through these offerings sacred spirits of the dead can be coaxed from the underworld to aid the living once more."
#summary "Race: Human, prefers Heat scale +2
Military: Well equipped and motivated warriors, archers and stealthy sacred warriors. Sacred ancestor spirits can be summoned.
Magic: Death, Blood, Air, Nature, Earth, some Fire and Glamour.
Priests: Average, cannot preach however can perform blood sacrifice. Blood sacrifice draws sacred vultures."
#brief "Great Arrada is a nation of well equipped and motivated warriors. Sacred ancestor spirits and royal ancestors can be summoned to bolster the army."
