#descr "Alchera is a hot, dusty land inhabited by one of the oldest human societies. The tribes of Alchera still follow ancient customs and remember the times when Monsters and Giants roamed the world. To them all times are one, as they live according to the ways of the Dreamtime which touches on all times. All Alcherans feel a connection to the Dreamtime and this guides and protects them in a world of hostile magic. Skilled Dreamers use this connection to work powerful Astral magic. Metalworking is unknown in the land of Alchera and its warriors are lightly armed and armored.
Recently, a group known as the Maohi have immigrated in large numbers, fleeing a catastrophe in their island home. The Maohi are a strong and proud people that revere the spirits of forests and the sea. With the coming of the Awakening God the Dreamspeakers of Alchera have united the tribes and the Maohi under one banner."
