#name "Houssa"
#epithet "Island in the Savannah"
#descr "When the Dreams of R'lyeh began to overtake the isle of Phaeacia, the Colossi voyaged across the sea and far inland to found a new refuge. The land they now occupied was one of conflict and constant war. Seven kingdoms of humans feuded and skirmished over territory. Before long, the kingdoms came into conflict with the Colossi, who answered with enchanted bronze and weapons the like their foes had never seen before. Twice, the Kingdoms were united by the Colossi. First in opposition, then in deferrence. The Seven Kingdoms recognised the slumbering god of Phaeacia as the ruler and progenitor of their own spirits and have accepted the Phaeacian faith as their own. Now, the descendants of the Queens of Phaeacia rule the surrounding lands from the grand city of Houssa. The Matriarchs consolidate political power into their families and squabble over even the most inconsequential decisions. Even now, with the coming of the Awakening God, it remains to be seen if the sleeping giant of Houssa will rise as well."
